  IconPath: icons/commodities/tech/fuse-copper.webp
  Description: You designed your armor to inaudibly thrum at just the right frequency
    to create interference against force and sound waves. You gain resistance equal
    to 3 + half your level to force and sonic damage. When under the effects of Overdrive,
    the resistance increases by 2.
